{"version":1,"content":"<p>視帝馬國明今晚（19日）現身台慶，與高海寧齊齊踏上無綫台慶紅地氈，事前被爆將與許志安同場。</p><p>心情靚絕的他受訪時被記者婉拒追問會否「坐到尾」，他大方回應：「等公司安排啦。</p><p>其實唔介意，件事都過咗咁耐啦，今晚齊齊賀公司生日嘛！</p><p>」&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:16:55.809450+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:44:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:10:13.307603+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:10:13.307603+00:00","content_hash":"dbedb4ccc4f806bd247e527d0b37efac8b2ea6623976142932838f7c1f47947f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}